==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], Adrift in Fear was an Insane stage. This was most likely a translation error.
*Adrift in Fear's Japanese name, Hyōryū Kyōshitsu (漂流恐失, "Lost and Fearfully Drifting"), sounds identical to the Japanese name of the manga ''[https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Manga/DriftingClassroom Drifting Classroom]'' (漂流教室) The joke is that the stage's name spells ''kyōshitsu'' as 恐失, which uses the kanji for "fear" (恐) and "mistake" or "loss" (失), whereas the manga uses 教室, the Japanese word for classroom.
*Prior to [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], the enemy base had 1,600,000 HP instead of 2,500,000.

